     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>This is a three-digit number.</p>\n<p>The first digit: 29</p>\n<p>The second digit: 16</p>\n<p>The third digit: 43</p>\n<p>29(60<sup>2</sup>) + 16(60) + 43 = 105,403</p>"
    },
